{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"にょーん。ひめにょんです(`・ω・')\nやばい。ひめにょんてワードにツボってしまった。わらわら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまっちー(生駒里奈chan）!　おたおめー!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ひめたんはおいちゃんの癒しよぉ(・∀・)ノ」て言ってくれるいこまっち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんよりお姉さんに見えないいこまっち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもふわふわしとるようで実はめっちゃ考えてるいこまっち\n好きやーあああ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。昨日はせいたんに家お泊まりー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん(畠中清羅chan)と語らい、爆睡し、1日楽しんだわず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドアあけた瞬間バニラの香りしたー∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おんなのこらしさ溢れるお部屋でした。さすがせいたん女子力高いねー\nブログ女王たま、日記もばっちり更新しとるしねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう鏡です。ひめたんもせいたんみたいになりたーい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。せいたんと夜お話しとったんぢゃけどね\nせいたんが音楽聴きながら一生懸命にお話ししてくれよって\nあれー？ひめたん相づち打たんくなったなーって思ったら\nひめたん寝とったらしい...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーごめん。ほんっとごめんね★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメ返一生懸命答えたけん、最後まで読んでな？（大分弁風）\nはいーひめたん大分弁もマスターしそうやけん♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5日の当落がもうすぐ出るんだよね。果たしてひめたんに挨拶に行けるのか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応募した方全員来てほしーい(o>ω<o)!\n当たったよーって方は報告待ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところで、『ドリミネーション』って、ドリーム+イルミネーションの事なの？？？\nDream + Illuminations = Dreamination ？？？かな？？？\n靴の周りは水晶のモチーフなのかな？ららちゃんの馬車、一般の人は乗れるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ドリームあんどイルミネーション。確かにそんな掛詞が隠れてるー!納得。\n◎ひめたんもそうだと思います(^^)くりすたる!\n◎りあるな話、ホームページで予約するとララちゃんの馬車に乗れるんとー。\nひめたんも来年はララちゃんに乗りたーい(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファミレスなら何処が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おともだちと行くのはサイゼリア\nふぁみりーと行くのはガスト\nメンバーと行くのはジョナサン\n囲みに東日本のジョナサン＝西日本のジョイフルなんだってー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山口県も近いしふぐとかも食べるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがおとなりの県の名産品って普段あんまり食べる機会ないですよっ\nふぐ食べたことないしー('`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはプレッシャーには弱いのかな?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレッシャー...うん弱い。弱いです。\n不安やら緊張やらはひめたんのお腹を刺激します('・ω・`)\nいや始まってしまえば楽なんですけどね。慣れるまでが長くてー...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、運動苦手なんだ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃは(ω)バレちゃった♪♪\n走る、飛ぶ、投げる、泳ぐ、何にもできません。てへぺろ。\nただしリズム感はあるみたいで、大縄跳びなんかは引っ掛かからんよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは学校でどんなキャラですか？？部活の後輩に怒ったりしますか？僕は学校で後輩に注意できなくて困っています＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校でもわりとこんな感じだと思いますよー。\nひとりだけおかしい子みたいになっとるんかなーって心配になりますか？←\nそれが、ひめたんの周りはみーんなおんなじノリだから全然浮いてないです♪\nさすが中坊ーわら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後輩には結構怒る人(∀)\nだって放送部元部長さんですよひめたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも注意するのって難しいですよね。\n信頼関係が出来上がってないと年上に耳を貸さないと思うし...。\nあー、もちろん怒るのも大事ぢゃけど、\n悪いとこ直ったらちゃんと認めることも大事だと思います(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はせいたんのコーデω))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2011/12/29/himeka0036_3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}